  ],
  "description": "Dynaset R over F with Filter \"N > 20\" and Sort \"N DESC\": Clone into C, read C's Filter and Sort, BOF, EOF, AbsolutePosition and ID, walk ID to EOF, MoveFirst and walk again. Then R.OpenRecordset() into R2, set R2 Filter \"N < 60\", R2.OpenRecordset() into R3, read R3's Filter and Sort, walk ID, FindFirst \"N = 40\", FindNext \"N = 40\", reading NoMatch, BOF, EOF and ID. Close R3, set R2 Sort \"ID\", R2.OpenRecordset() into R4, read Sort, walk ID. Then C.OpenRecordset() into R5, read its Filter and Sort and walk ID. Asks whether clones and derived recordsets inherit or compose Filter and Sort, and the order of Find in a derived recordset. The fixture copy is opened read-only.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
    "clearErrorInfoBefore",
    "excepinfo",
    "deferredFill",
    "errorInfo"
  ],
